# Example: how to teach a server (rename to .md to activate)
- Server name: Example SMP. Java IP: play.example.com. Season 4 started 2026-03-01.
- Rules: no griefing, no x-ray, PvP only in the Arena.
- Lifesteal rule of thumb: killing a player steals 1 heart; at 0 hearts you are banned until revived.
